<title>UK: METALS MIXED AT LME CLOSE, PRICES CUT LOSSES.</title>
<headline>METALS MIXED AT LME CLOSE, PRICES CUT LOSSES.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Finishes steadier, still range-bound.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Cuts losses, close under $1,700 soft on charts.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Tumbles in late trade, ends weak.</p>
<p>LEAD - Finishes steadier, above $600. TIN - Steady.</p>
<p>ZINC - Ends with small gains, below highs.</p>
</text>
